Z||000032||Cheever2||05-08-2001||03:28 AM||||On that lighter note... and maybe it's best to go on to this different subject... have you seen the "Application To Date My Daughter"?  It's very funny.  I have a hardcopy of it, but would take a long time to type it up.  Maybe someone has it on a website.<P>JohnnyK, first drink's on me, if we do meet someday.  Keep posting your opinion, and I will too.  Mostly I just want to have fun and smile whenever possible, although it didn't sound like it here.  Sorry for crashing the party, Tweeks.<BR>||||reg||6
Z||000033||Patrick's Dad||05-08-2001||09:12 AM||||Hi guys,<P>My brother sent me the application to date my daughter when my girl was born last year. I especially liked; "What do you want to be if you grow up?"<P>There was another one floating around, the rules of dating my daughter. Rule one was, "If you drive up to my house and beep, you'd better be dropping something off, because you sure as hell aren't picking anything up." Another favorite referred to my using my power staplegun to fasten the loose pants to your waist, just to make sure they don't "accidentally" fall off.<P>I have personally said that, simply by virtue of not having male genitalia, my daughter is automatically grounded until she is 35. Any subsequent offense is merely added time.<P>A friend of mine, who is a photographer, showed me his latest test shots. Whenever he gets new gear or learns a new technique, he always tests with his daughter, now 14. I looked at my friend, also an NRA member in good standing, and said, "I think that you need to get TWO guns."<P>And yes, I agree heartily that we, as a society, are learning to prey on our weakest members. (WARNING: Religious freak statemement about to be issued!) First boys and girls who aren't born yet, then on to the elderly, women, children (who did get to be born).... and so it goes. Not with a bang, but a whimper.||||reg||1
Z||000034||firstfiero||05-08-2001||09:19 AM||||     Let me get this right cheever...You have the right to play mini golf and not be bothered but I don't have the right to freedom of speech? I don't care how you asked I'd say f### you and tell ya to scram. And you could beat me all you want. Let's see how impressed your children are when daddy's sitting in jail for assault. Again I have children...but I don't care if someone swears around them. They know it's wrong because I've taken the time to TEACH them it's wrong. It's not a worry! <P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif">         <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||1
